1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,170
My hometown is a small town in southern China.
我的家乡是中国南方的一座小镇。

2
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:13,010
When I went back there last summer, I was amazed by the great changes that had taken place in recent years.
去年夏天我回到家乡时，近几年发生的巨大变化让我惊叹不已。

3
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:16,350
The most obvious change is in transportation.
最明显的变化是在交通方面。

4
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:26,540
Narrow dirt roads have been replaced by wide paved ones, and a new high-speed rail line has cut the trip to the provincial capital from five hours to one and a half.
狭窄的土路被宽阔的柏油路取代，一条新建的高铁线路把去省会的路程从五个小时缩短到一个半小时。

5
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:30,230
Daily life has also become much more convenient.
日常生活也变得方便多了。

6
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:38,160
A supermarket and a modern hospital have opened, and many elderly residents now pay for groceries with their phones.
一家超市和一所现代化医院开张了，许多老年居民现在买菜都用手机付款。

7
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:42,260
What pleases me most is that the environment has improved.
最让我高兴的是环境得到了改善。

8
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:50,690
The polluted river near my old house has been cleaned up, and the new park along its banks has become a favorite spot for evening walks.
我老房子附近那条被污染的河流已经治理干净，河岸边的新公园成了人们傍晚散步最喜欢去的地方。

9
00:00:51,490 --> 00:01:00,380
These developments have made life in my hometown more comfortable, and some young people who once worked in big cities have even returned to start businesses.
这些发展让家乡的生活更加舒适，一些曾经在大城市工作的年轻人甚至回乡创业。

10
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:06,250
I am proud of my hometown, and I hope to contribute to its future after graduation.
我为我的家乡感到骄傲，希望毕业后能为它的未来出一份力。
